                                    "text": "It's fine. Take your time."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "721300505",
                                    "speaker": "Kaji",
                                    "text": "And if you don't manage it, just leave it. The most important thing is that you shouldn't stay in this place too long — it's dangerous."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
